WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.790 --> 01:40.980
Since this is your plan,

01:41.510 --> 01:43.290
I'm in. I'll help you.

01:44.430 --> 01:45.330
Thank you, Yunxiao.

01:46.590 --> 01:48.330
All I need to do now

01:48.350 --> 01:50.660
is stay low in Jade Division

01:50.760 --> 01:52.850
and wait for Ao Yi to show up.

01:53.120 --> 01:54.460
But aren't you afraid

01:55.040 --> 01:56.620
the Westdawn Sect will find you?

01:57.510 --> 01:58.490
Don't worry.

01:58.710 --> 02:00.180
I've made full preparations

02:00.200 --> 02:01.540
and recalled all my paper butterflies.

02:01.560 --> 02:03.740
Even if Westdawn has crazy power,

02:04.000 --> 02:06.100
they won't find my location.

02:15.470 --> 02:16.780
Grandlord.

02:16.910 --> 02:17.690
Grandlord.

02:20.120 --> 02:22.130
Bare legs? How improper.

02:24.470 --> 02:25.260
Grandlord.

02:25.360 --> 02:26.940
Go save them at Jade Division.

02:27.360 --> 02:28.890
Or it'll be too late.

02:30.430 --> 02:32.690
Xuanya, what's going on?

02:32.870 --> 02:33.660
Grandlord.

02:33.680 --> 02:35.850
Zhao Gongming is heading
to Jade Division with his men.

02:35.960 --> 02:36.730
Jade Division?

02:37.940 --> 02:40.860
[Episode 17]

02:44.000 --> 02:45.500
Disciples above Verity Immortal,

02:45.520 --> 02:47.060
head to Jade Division at once.

02:47.080 --> 02:47.690
Yes.

02:50.560 --> 02:51.450
Jade Division?

02:51.870 --> 02:52.890
Got some nerve, Zhao Gongming.

02:52.910 --> 02:54.220
How dare you mess with Changshou?

02:59.030 --> 03:00.540
I, Detached Master of Ascendance Sect,

03:01.360 --> 03:03.220
implore you to show mercy.

03:03.750 --> 03:05.890
Don't pick on our juniors.

03:12.310 --> 03:14.820
If our sect offended you,

03:15.080 --> 03:16.660
I'll take the blame.

03:16.910 --> 03:19.780
Please come back.

03:32.630 --> 03:33.450
I want to,

03:34.280 --> 03:35.260
but I'm stuck.

03:35.300 --> 03:36.000
[Lost?]

03:36.000 --> 03:37.820
Lost?

03:38.840 --> 03:40.450
What jerk set up this formation?

03:40.630 --> 03:41.850
The safe path is a dead end.

03:41.960 --> 03:43.260
And the dead end is still one.

03:43.470 --> 03:44.450
What kind of formation is this?

03:45.470 --> 03:46.610
It's playing me for a fool.

03:47.030 --> 03:48.100
Is there no law anymore?

03:49.000 --> 03:50.220
Come out, and I'll spank you.

03:57.240 --> 03:58.010
Qi Yuan.

03:58.840 --> 03:59.610
Grandlord.

04:00.310 --> 04:01.130
What's going on?

04:04.120 --> 04:05.100
My disciple did it.

04:05.310 --> 04:07.220
He's not good at talismans or spells.

04:07.910 --> 04:09.660
But he's good at formations.

04:13.280 --> 04:14.010
Formations?

04:14.030 --> 04:14.780
Yes.

04:17.920 --> 04:19.780
[Steady]
This exposed my formation card,

04:19.800 --> 04:21.660
but humans using them to survive

04:21.680 --> 04:23.140
fits my persona quite well.

04:25.040 --> 04:27.250
Why are there a hundred senses outside?

04:28.000 --> 04:29.930
Feels like the whole sect is out there.

04:32.160 --> 04:34.930
Using formations to escape? Clever.

04:35.720 --> 04:38.410
But this is just a basic layout.

04:38.830 --> 04:41.050
Why is he struggling so much?

04:42.040 --> 04:42.810
Grandlord.

04:43.190 --> 04:44.220
I know this one.

04:45.330 --> 04:47.160
♪Who sings and drinks free♪

04:47.360 --> 04:48.490
This is a linked formation.

04:48.920 --> 04:50.540
After the safe path of one area,

04:50.560 --> 04:52.700
comes the next setup.

04:52.870 --> 04:54.660
To crack this formation,

04:55.040 --> 04:55.930
one must have...

04:56.080 --> 04:57.680
♪Who can ever♪

04:57.680 --> 05:00.250
elite formation skills.

05:00.510 --> 05:01.410
How do you know that?

05:03.830 --> 05:04.460
Actually, I...

05:04.480 --> 05:05.850
Never mind. Forget it.

05:06.680 --> 05:08.100
Since everyone is here,

05:08.830 --> 05:09.610
Qi Yuan,

05:10.390 --> 05:11.700
go bring him out.

05:13.480 --> 05:14.250
I...

05:14.250 --> 05:15.960
♪I drink the breeze that comes my way♪

05:15.960 --> 05:17.460
♪The steadiest surge of all♪

05:17.680 --> 05:19.250
Fine. You go, young disciple.

05:19.270 --> 05:19.980
Me?

05:20.380 --> 05:21.830
♪Karma never falls empty♪

05:21.830 --> 05:22.610
Or maybe...

05:22.610 --> 05:24.480
♪Let the thoughts weigh♪

05:24.710 --> 05:26.620
♪Will fulfill the heart's desire♪

05:26.890 --> 05:27.930
♪Unruly♪

05:29.430 --> 05:31.220
Grandlord, my stomach's upset.

05:31.240 --> 05:33.290
I'll go take care of it.

05:46.720 --> 05:48.290
You brat, should I save you?

05:48.430 --> 05:49.250
Don't worry.

05:50.040 --> 05:51.020
I can still hold on.

05:51.680 --> 05:52.540
Do you have a plan?

05:53.120 --> 05:55.250
I'm reading everyone's spiritual sense,

05:55.600 --> 05:57.020
looking for a way to break this.

05:57.510 --> 05:59.490
Once I confirm who they are...

06:03.190 --> 06:04.460
The one we're waiting for is here.

06:17.560 --> 06:18.250
Uncle.

06:18.830 --> 06:20.050
We've figured it out.

06:20.190 --> 06:20.980
Go east.

06:21.560 --> 06:22.340
Are you sure?

06:22.950 --> 06:23.900
Very sure.

06:23.920 --> 06:26.050
We studied it forever. No mistake.

06:26.480 --> 06:27.250
Okay.

06:27.600 --> 06:28.410
Wait there.

06:28.430 --> 06:29.100
Okay.

06:33.680 --> 06:35.170
Wait, let's check it again.

06:41.100 --> 06:44.500
[Lost?]

06:44.510 --> 06:45.340
Lost...

06:46.870 --> 06:48.050
Lost here too...

06:49.190 --> 06:50.660
And lost over here...

06:53.040 --> 06:54.460
Think it's over?

06:55.190 --> 06:56.730
I'm a genius with directions.

06:57.430 --> 06:58.660
No way this side is wrong.

07:09.030 --> 07:11.030
♪I don't ask, too lazy to fight♪

07:11.290 --> 07:13.320
♪I dare to live my own way♪

07:13.320 --> 07:15.610
♪In the Primordial World♪

07:16.740 --> 07:17.690
[Lost?]

07:17.690 --> 07:19.750
♪The stars smile at fireflies♪

07:20.040 --> 07:21.940
♪Roaming the city with reckless courage♪

07:22.920 --> 07:23.900
Who designed this?

07:25.190 --> 07:25.980
Genius.

07:25.980 --> 07:28.070
♪Who can ever♪

07:28.070 --> 07:28.850
Truly ingenious.

07:30.560 --> 07:31.540
Formation arts

07:32.120 --> 07:33.490
might be unorthodox,

07:34.360 --> 07:35.580
but when used right,

07:35.600 --> 07:36.540
they work wonders.

07:37.320 --> 07:39.450
♪Let the answer be empty♪

07:39.450 --> 07:40.480
♪A varied life♪

07:40.480 --> 07:42.050
What's going on here?

07:42.070 --> 07:43.610
Why is everyone rushing over?

07:45.360 --> 07:47.220
Uncle, this formation is dangerous.

07:47.240 --> 07:48.250
Don't fall in.

07:48.270 --> 07:49.050
Formations?

07:49.360 --> 07:50.730
Looks pretty simple to me.

07:51.430 --> 07:52.850
I'll go bring Uncle back.

07:53.950 --> 07:54.730
Uncle.

07:54.730 --> 07:56.680
♪Will fulfill our original vow♪

07:57.040 --> 07:58.100
♪Unruly♪

07:58.100 --> 08:01.160
♪A carefree smile♪

08:06.430 --> 08:09.020
Mentor, can Uncle crack this?

08:09.870 --> 08:11.020
Are you kidding me?

08:11.160 --> 08:12.780
I studied it forever and failed.

08:12.800 --> 08:14.170
If he can crack it in one glance,

08:14.190 --> 08:14.850
then I...

08:15.310 --> 08:16.290
I'll take him as my mentor.

08:16.510 --> 08:18.220
Then hurry and get him out.

08:18.240 --> 08:18.780
Don't worry.

08:18.800 --> 08:19.610
Saving one or saving two,

08:19.630 --> 08:20.610
it's all the same.

08:20.630 --> 08:21.700
Let me figure this out first.

08:31.540 --> 08:34.420
[Lost?]

08:39.740 --> 08:45.670
[Lost?]

08:45.670 --> 08:46.460
Don't panic.

08:47.320 --> 08:48.180
A basic formation.

08:48.200 --> 08:49.460
You studied it at the Dragon Palace.

08:52.120 --> 08:52.940
The safe path is...

08:57.670 --> 08:58.460
This way.

09:01.380 --> 09:02.380
[Lost?]

09:04.700 --> 09:05.380
[Lost?]

09:06.200 --> 09:07.340
Lost again?

09:08.180 --> 09:08.780
[Lost?]

09:11.060 --> 09:11.820
[Lost?]

09:14.500 --> 09:15.820
[Lost?]

09:17.910 --> 09:18.850
Again?

09:19.740 --> 09:21.820
[The path is beneath your feet]

09:29.020 --> 09:30.660
[The path is beneath your feet]

09:31.870 --> 09:34.610
The path is beneath your feet?

09:34.610 --> 09:35.580
[The path is beneath your feet]

09:44.000 --> 09:44.770
I think

09:46.550 --> 09:47.890
I've seen it somewhere.

09:56.630 --> 09:57.220
Correct.

10:03.340 --> 10:05.980
[Ao Yi's 1st Formation Layer]

10:14.390 --> 10:15.180
Mentor.

10:15.480 --> 10:16.610
Did Uncle...

10:17.030 --> 10:18.130
It's just the first layer.

10:18.150 --> 10:19.250
The first layer is easy.

10:19.270 --> 10:20.420
The hard part comes next.

10:31.380 --> 10:33.580
[Ao Yi's 2nd Formation Layer]

10:53.580 --> 10:55.140
[Death]

10:56.910 --> 10:57.650
Bingo.

10:58.380 --> 10:59.260
[Life]

10:59.680 --> 11:02.530
♪Once a drifting weed, I loved to roam♪

11:02.530 --> 11:04.710
♪Now, a levee holds back the storm♪

11:05.060 --> 11:08.040
♪Fight against fate for my life♪

11:08.040 --> 11:10.840
♪Close eyes to sense the world♪

11:10.840 --> 11:13.290
♪Years splash ink♪

11:13.670 --> 11:14.530
He has

11:16.720 --> 11:18.060
the scent of the East Sea.

11:19.480 --> 11:20.250
He is...

11:20.390 --> 11:21.850
Uncle is amazing.

11:21.870 --> 11:22.940
He cracked the second layer too.

11:23.460 --> 11:25.420
[Ao Yi's 3rd Formation Layer
Life]

11:28.030 --> 11:30.900
♪Transcending gods and demons above♪

11:30.900 --> 11:32.860
[Lost?]

11:33.510 --> 11:34.700
I miss my mom.

11:35.100 --> 11:36.160
[Lost?]

11:36.160 --> 11:37.530
♪If smooth, seek peace♪

11:37.530 --> 11:38.870
♪If tough, stay still;
who fates good and evil♪

11:38.870 --> 11:39.650
Over here.

11:40.080 --> 11:41.010
Help me.

11:41.200 --> 11:42.130
I don't want to stay here.

11:42.150 --> 11:43.130
I'm never coming back.

11:43.270 --> 11:44.250
Don't panic, Uncle.

11:44.390 --> 11:45.770
I'm cracking the formation.

11:45.790 --> 11:46.700
I'll come back for you.

11:46.720 --> 11:47.850
Right. Break this formation.

11:47.870 --> 11:49.340
Break... Break it now.

11:49.960 --> 11:51.730
♪Arrows in flesh as the string♪

11:51.730 --> 11:53.250
♪Chaos births a flowing ode♪

11:53.250 --> 11:55.200
♪Standing tall, heart hides its might♪

11:55.200 --> 11:57.510
[Scene]

11:57.510 --> 11:58.450
♪Beneath the vast world♪

11:58.450 --> 12:00.480
♪The furnace refines my pure heart♪

12:00.480 --> 12:02.460
♪Dragon reborn breaks the chains♪

12:02.460 --> 12:03.980
[Life]

12:04.150 --> 12:07.150
♪With firm resolve, I roam the sky♪

12:07.150 --> 12:08.070
♪Under crushing weight♪

12:08.070 --> 12:09.700
♪Wings lift toward clear skies♪

12:09.700 --> 12:10.780
♪Who sits on the ground?♪

12:10.780 --> 12:12.370
♪Spawning endless heavenly troops♪

12:12.370 --> 12:13.390
♪Charging against the wind♪

12:13.390 --> 12:15.050
♪Old scars reveal the truth♪

12:15.050 --> 12:15.870
♪Even if all brave men fall♪

12:15.870 --> 12:17.050
♪Chugging the murky wine♪

12:17.050 --> 12:19.290
♪Close eyes to sense the world♪

12:19.520 --> 12:22.120
♪Years splash ink♪

12:22.120 --> 12:24.200
♪Trekking far and wide♪

12:24.200 --> 12:27.610
♪Silent in subtleties♪

12:28.780 --> 12:30.300
[Death]

12:31.340 --> 12:33.600
[Death]

12:33.600 --> 12:35.530
Last step, and you still missed.

12:35.750 --> 12:36.610
But,

12:37.630 --> 12:38.940
let me fix that for you.

12:39.620 --> 12:40.020
[Life]

12:43.220 --> 12:44.460
[Life]

13:01.320 --> 13:02.650
Finally. The formation is cracked.

13:02.750 --> 13:03.530
Uncle.

13:03.670 --> 13:04.300
Are you okay?

13:04.320 --> 13:04.700
I'm fine.

13:04.720 --> 13:06.060
How dare you, Zhao Gongming?

13:06.080 --> 13:07.530
Leave him alone!

13:09.960 --> 13:10.580
You walked right into my hands.

13:11.150 --> 13:12.130
Here comes a big one.

13:13.000 --> 13:14.100
Come on.

13:14.550 --> 13:15.770
Rise.

13:22.080 --> 13:22.850
Uncle.

13:23.240 --> 13:24.730
Don't be so reckless next time.

13:24.750 --> 13:26.250
Senior was worried sick about you.

13:26.750 --> 13:27.650
It was just a formation.

13:27.670 --> 13:28.530
A piece of cake.

13:29.390 --> 13:30.010
It's him.

13:30.270 --> 13:31.060
Fall back.

13:31.270 --> 13:32.060
Yes.

13:37.510 --> 13:38.530
What kind of formation is this?

13:39.320 --> 13:40.370
Actually,

13:40.390 --> 13:41.180
my Senior's formations

13:41.200 --> 13:42.820
are exceptionally weird.

13:42.840 --> 13:44.610
Every time he shuts them down,

13:44.630 --> 13:46.060
smoke just poofs right out.

13:46.080 --> 13:47.060
Poof.

13:48.360 --> 13:49.130
I see.

13:49.630 --> 13:51.250
He can't control it smoothly.

13:51.360 --> 13:52.340
This young disciple

13:53.000 --> 13:54.490
has a weak cultivation base.

13:54.510 --> 13:55.250
Where are you?

13:55.440 --> 13:56.580
Zhao Gongming, come out.

13:56.600 --> 13:57.460
Show yourself if you dare.

13:57.480 --> 13:58.730
Don't mess with Changshou.

13:58.910 --> 14:00.890
The formation should be broken now.

14:01.270 --> 14:01.770
Quick.

14:02.600 --> 14:03.700
- Get Jiu Jiu back now.
- Come out here.

14:04.910 --> 14:05.370
Jiu Jiu.

14:05.720 --> 14:06.180
Grandlord.

14:06.270 --> 14:08.060
Jiu Jiu, don't cause more trouble.

14:08.910 --> 14:10.250
Quick, go find Zhao Gongming.

14:10.600 --> 14:11.370
Remember,

14:11.390 --> 14:12.850
never engage him in combat.

14:13.480 --> 14:14.250
Grandlord.

14:14.550 --> 14:15.460
I don't understand.

14:15.550 --> 14:17.250
Why such fear of Zhao Gongming?

14:19.870 --> 14:22.060
You juniors wouldn't know.

14:22.080 --> 14:24.460
Zhao Gongming is not someone to cross.

15:01.080 --> 15:03.730
He's the top outer sect disciple

15:03.750 --> 15:04.730
under the Heavenreach Master
of the Seizing Sect.

15:04.870 --> 15:06.610
He is highly favored
by the Heavenreach Master.

15:06.790 --> 15:08.940
He once decreed to the Three Realms,

15:08.960 --> 15:10.610
anyone who harms his disciples

15:11.080 --> 15:12.220
will make an enemy of him.

15:12.720 --> 15:14.490
He'll use the Power of a Saint

15:14.750 --> 15:16.300
to crush them to pieces.

15:16.550 --> 15:18.940
Zhao Gongming relies on those words

15:19.080 --> 15:20.490
to pick fights everywhere.

15:20.510 --> 15:21.460
He falls at a simple touch.

15:26.000 --> 15:27.100
Like this, exactly.

15:27.120 --> 15:28.770
And then he demands money.

15:29.320 --> 15:30.100
Pay up.

15:31.270 --> 15:33.010
No one dares cross Heavenreach Master.

15:33.480 --> 15:35.300
So they just pay up quietly.

15:36.150 --> 15:37.890
How much can he get out of them?

15:39.910 --> 15:40.890
Let's put it this way.

15:41.840 --> 15:43.250
The face of the God of Wealth

15:43.510 --> 15:45.700
is modeled on Zhao Gongming.

15:45.700 --> 15:46.900
[Bring Wealth and Treasures]

15:48.720 --> 15:49.490
What?

15:49.720 --> 15:51.420
The God of Wealth?

15:58.390 --> 15:59.460
A severe fracture.

15:59.480 --> 16:00.490
Look at this.

16:00.510 --> 16:01.700
The outside looks fine,

16:01.720 --> 16:02.580
but it's shattered inside.

16:02.600 --> 16:04.060
This will cost at least
3,000 Spirit Stones.

16:04.240 --> 16:05.010
Or do you have something

16:05.030 --> 16:05.730
like the Primordial Vessel?

16:05.750 --> 16:06.460
We can trade.

16:06.480 --> 16:07.250
The Primordial Vessel.

16:09.120 --> 16:11.010
Wait, Yunxiao, you know him, right?

16:14.480 --> 16:15.250
Hey.

16:16.200 --> 16:17.060
Yunxiao.

16:18.030 --> 16:18.820
Oh my.

16:20.030 --> 16:21.610
That's fracture.

16:21.630 --> 16:23.060
Take a look. That's it.

16:24.630 --> 16:25.420
Yunxiao.

16:25.870 --> 16:26.610
I finally found you.

16:26.630 --> 16:27.370
Don't worry.

16:27.440 --> 16:28.490
I found the jerk who messed with you.

16:28.510 --> 16:29.700
I'll get the Vessel back right now.

16:29.720 --> 16:30.460
I'm working on it.

16:30.960 --> 16:31.730
Give me a second.

16:37.840 --> 16:38.610
Yunxiao?

16:42.240 --> 16:44.130
The Vessel is safe in my hands.

16:44.150 --> 16:45.650
Why would you need to get it back?

16:45.670 --> 16:46.460
Are you looking for a beating?

16:46.480 --> 16:47.100
Yunxiao, here's the thing.

16:47.120 --> 16:48.060
I'm not done lecturing him.

16:48.080 --> 16:48.820
Sorry.

16:55.790 --> 16:56.460
I...

16:57.150 --> 16:58.250
was just worried about you.

16:58.910 --> 17:01.250
We agreed to use the Ruyi Comms daily

17:01.510 --> 17:02.460
to check in.

17:03.390 --> 17:04.290
Since you left the Dragon Palace,

17:04.310 --> 17:05.660
there's been zero news.

17:05.680 --> 17:07.250
My Ruyi Comms didn't ring once.

17:07.270 --> 17:08.290
I looked all over for you.

17:08.920 --> 17:09.810
Then I ran into someone

17:10.550 --> 17:11.050
who said,

17:11.720 --> 17:13.900
they saw Changgeng at Dragon Palace

17:13.920 --> 17:15.250
using your Primordial Vessel.

17:15.270 --> 17:16.050
Who?

17:16.070 --> 17:16.700
Changgeng.

17:18.270 --> 17:18.940
That man?

17:18.960 --> 17:19.900
I don't know who he is.

17:20.070 --> 17:21.660
Never met him, just heard his voice.

17:22.790 --> 17:24.050
That mysterious man again.

17:28.310 --> 17:29.900
He must be from the Westdawn Sect.

17:35.310 --> 17:36.140
Oh no, Yunxiao.

17:36.270 --> 17:37.050
You're done for.

17:37.720 --> 17:38.530
You've fallen for him.

17:43.590 --> 17:44.420
Zip it.

17:52.240 --> 17:53.420
You mess things up every time.

17:53.720 --> 17:55.090
You never consider the consequences.

17:55.110 --> 17:56.420
Who'd you pick up that temper from?

17:56.960 --> 17:58.140
Who else?

17:58.160 --> 17:59.010
Just know this.

17:59.030 --> 18:00.290
I'm working on something big.

18:00.310 --> 18:01.460
And no more questions about it.

18:01.590 --> 18:02.490
Fine, no more questions.

18:03.200 --> 18:05.010
That brat is my helper.

18:05.200 --> 18:06.290
From now on, you will not harm him.

18:06.310 --> 18:07.050
I won't.

18:07.720 --> 18:09.810
Obey his orders from now on.

18:09.830 --> 18:10.420
Understood?

18:10.440 --> 18:11.180
No.

18:11.920 --> 18:13.010
Yes, yes.

18:15.000 --> 18:16.090
If I catch you

18:16.110 --> 18:17.810
messing up on your own again,

18:17.830 --> 18:20.050
I'll break your foundation.

18:30.830 --> 18:31.620
Your foundation?

18:36.350 --> 18:37.140
Buddy.

18:37.960 --> 18:38.660
Don't misunderstand.

18:39.240 --> 18:40.530
She's my sister.

18:40.920 --> 18:42.460
Outside, I give her face.

18:43.030 --> 18:44.050
Pretending to fear her.

18:44.440 --> 18:45.860
But at home, she's afraid of me.

18:46.790 --> 18:48.250
I scold her every time I see her.

18:48.480 --> 18:49.250
Really.

18:49.350 --> 18:50.180
To her face.

19:09.680 --> 19:10.620
May I ask, sir?

19:11.000 --> 19:11.860
I have erased

19:11.880 --> 19:13.700
all my traces in the outside world.

19:13.790 --> 19:15.810
How did you find me at Jade Division?

19:18.960 --> 19:20.140
That's easy.

19:20.350 --> 19:21.420
I checked one by one.

19:21.510 --> 19:22.530
One by one?

19:23.640 --> 19:24.490
That man told me,

19:24.510 --> 19:26.900
Changgeng must be among those

19:27.350 --> 19:28.220
who went to Dragon Palace.

19:28.590 --> 19:29.700
There are only a few of them.

19:29.720 --> 19:30.770
Bluff them one by one,

19:30.790 --> 19:31.860
and one will slip, right?

19:32.440 --> 19:34.010
Bluff them one by one?

19:34.550 --> 19:35.530
How many did you try?

19:36.440 --> 19:37.250
Not many.

19:38.400 --> 19:40.490
Wang Qi and Liu Sizhe of Spiritkin.

19:41.030 --> 19:42.490
And you're the third.

19:42.550 --> 19:43.900
If I hadn't got it right,

19:43.920 --> 19:44.940
I'd have gone to the Skyrend Division

19:45.070 --> 19:46.250
to find that Xuanya.

19:46.440 --> 19:47.330
I planned to hit all divisions

19:47.350 --> 19:49.090
until I succeeded.

19:49.550 --> 19:50.620
How much did you take from them?

19:50.640 --> 19:51.140
Those two?

19:52.070 --> 19:52.860
Not much.

19:53.240 --> 19:54.220
Really, not much.

19:54.240 --> 19:55.290
They're dirt poor.

19:56.070 --> 19:56.940
Liu Sizhe.

19:57.160 --> 19:57.940
Junior.

19:59.240 --> 20:00.460
How much do you have left?

20:02.750 --> 20:03.940
A century of savings...

20:04.720 --> 20:05.810
Completely gone.

20:06.720 --> 20:07.490
What about you?

20:10.510 --> 20:11.660
I have nothing left.

20:11.680 --> 20:13.460
See? Absolutely nothing.

20:17.000 --> 20:18.380
That Zhao Gongming...

20:21.830 --> 20:22.620
Changshou?

20:23.400 --> 20:24.180
Changshou?

20:24.720 --> 20:25.420
Changshou?

20:25.440 --> 20:26.140
Senior?

20:27.070 --> 20:27.860
Senior?

20:28.440 --> 20:29.250
Senior?

20:31.310 --> 20:33.810
Going out now won't find him anyway.

20:34.920 --> 20:36.330
Since I know his real identity,

20:36.350 --> 20:38.290
no rush to meet him right away.

20:39.070 --> 20:39.860
Brother-in-law...

20:40.750 --> 20:41.530
Buddy.

20:42.510 --> 20:43.700
As long as I'm here,

20:43.750 --> 20:44.700
no one lays a hand on you.

20:44.720 --> 20:46.220
We're the ones calling the shots.

20:50.680 --> 20:53.770
With a Seizing Sect master like you,

20:53.790 --> 20:55.420
I'm definitely relieved.

20:55.680 --> 20:56.530
But,

20:56.830 --> 20:58.730
since you formed such big karma,

21:00.030 --> 21:01.940
you might have to pay a price.

21:03.110 --> 21:04.050
What price?

21:05.440 --> 21:06.250
Hard to say.

21:06.750 --> 21:07.530
Hard to say.

21:08.680 --> 21:09.460
Who's that?

21:11.590 --> 21:12.290
What are you

21:12.400 --> 21:13.140
looking for?

21:14.480 --> 21:15.290
Let me help.

21:15.480 --> 21:16.010
There.

21:17.510 --> 21:18.420
What is that?

21:22.920 --> 21:23.860
There's nothing there.

21:25.440 --> 21:27.420
Hold on. What's that?

21:35.160 --> 21:35.940
What's going on?

21:37.880 --> 21:38.700
What's wrong?

21:38.920 --> 21:40.290
You mustache guy.

21:40.880 --> 21:41.900
Why did you attack

21:41.920 --> 21:43.980
an unnamed Ascendance Sect disciple?

21:47.880 --> 21:48.860
When did that happen?

21:50.030 --> 21:51.380
My foundation is damaged.

21:52.030 --> 21:54.050
I won't recover for 5,000 years.

21:55.440 --> 21:56.980
Wait, isn't that my line?

21:58.070 --> 21:58.380
This...

21:58.440 --> 21:58.900
Changshou.

21:58.960 --> 21:59.250
Senior.

21:59.440 --> 22:00.220
Junior.

22:00.680 --> 22:01.570
Senior.

22:01.720 --> 22:04.770
Senior, don't you die.

22:04.790 --> 22:06.730
Senior, you can't die.

22:06.750 --> 22:07.460
No, no.

22:07.480 --> 22:09.220
Senior, what am I to do?

22:09.400 --> 22:11.250
Senior, wake up.

22:11.270 --> 22:12.700
Take care of our Mentor.

22:12.720 --> 22:13.420
Senior.

22:16.400 --> 22:17.140
Awful acting.

22:17.310 --> 22:19.220
Senior. Senior.

22:19.880 --> 22:20.810
Simply awful.

22:20.830 --> 22:21.900
Too realistic.

22:31.960 --> 22:33.050
Can I defend myself?

22:33.070 --> 22:33.660
No.

22:34.400 --> 22:35.140
Changshou.

22:35.310 --> 22:36.530
Changshou, are you okay?

22:36.550 --> 22:38.050
Please don't die, Changshou.

22:38.070 --> 22:39.010
He's not going to die.

22:39.030 --> 22:40.730
Changshou, are you okay?

22:40.830 --> 22:41.460
Changshou.

22:41.480 --> 22:41.900
Senior.

22:42.270 --> 22:42.860
Changshou.

22:42.880 --> 22:44.290
I'll take you to Azure Palace.

22:44.310 --> 22:46.090
- Let's confront Heavenreach Master.
- Not the Azure Palace.

22:46.310 --> 22:47.140
This isn't over.

22:47.160 --> 22:48.900
I'll shave off his mustache.

22:49.350 --> 22:49.900
Let go of me.

22:49.920 --> 22:50.460
Calm down.

22:50.480 --> 22:51.380
I didn't even touch him.

22:51.750 --> 22:52.460
Calm down.

22:52.480 --> 22:52.770
Senior.

22:52.790 --> 22:54.140
I'll shave you. Let go of me.

22:54.310 --> 22:54.770
Calm down.

22:55.160 --> 22:55.380
Calm down.

22:55.400 --> 22:55.700
Don't hold me back.

22:55.720 --> 22:56.330
Calm down, calm down.

22:56.350 --> 22:57.140
I'll rip your mustache off.

22:57.160 --> 22:58.050
Let go of me.

22:58.070 --> 22:59.140
Calm down.

23:06.310 --> 23:07.220
You little brat.

23:08.070 --> 23:09.810
Using my tricks on me.

23:11.030 --> 23:11.810
Fine.

23:13.550 --> 23:14.330
I'll name a price

23:14.550 --> 23:16.010
to make you happy, okay?

23:17.720 --> 23:18.250
Senior.

23:18.510 --> 23:19.290
3,000.

23:20.270 --> 23:20.700
5,000.

23:20.720 --> 23:21.530
That's too much.

23:21.920 --> 23:23.900
Senior, don't die.

23:23.920 --> 23:24.770
I'll rip your mustache off.

23:24.790 --> 23:26.010
- I didn't even touch you.
- Let go of me.

23:26.110 --> 23:26.810
You just lie down there.

23:26.830 --> 23:27.460
Let go.

23:27.480 --> 23:28.730
And you're... 5,000.

23:29.270 --> 23:30.250
I'm healed.

23:30.790 --> 23:32.050
I feel so great.

23:34.110 --> 23:34.980
Isn't this awful acting?

23:35.000 --> 23:36.180
Isn't this realistic?

23:36.200 --> 23:36.860
It's...

23:51.590 --> 23:52.380
Money.

23:53.030 --> 23:53.810
So much money.

23:57.590 --> 23:58.140
No, no, no.

23:58.200 --> 23:58.770
It's mine.

24:01.830 --> 24:02.460
Here, here.

24:03.510 --> 24:04.050
Here.

24:09.550 --> 24:10.330
Grandlord.

24:11.030 --> 24:12.330
Is this real money?

24:12.400 --> 24:13.620
Of course it's real.

24:14.880 --> 24:15.940
So much money.

24:16.590 --> 24:17.730
Where did you get it?

24:20.110 --> 24:21.050
I scammed it.

24:21.720 --> 24:23.330
He's been at it for millennia.

24:23.350 --> 24:24.770
You mustache guy.

24:25.350 --> 24:27.730
5,000 Spirit Stones, in coins?

24:28.830 --> 24:29.530
Count them.

24:32.590 --> 24:34.860
Xiong Lingli, come on up.

24:36.160 --> 24:38.330
Brothers, I'm coming.

24:38.640 --> 24:40.730
Hurry up. Hold on tight.

24:41.920 --> 24:42.620
Xiong Er.

24:42.640 --> 24:43.860
Xiong Lingli, hurry up.

24:44.000 --> 24:44.460
Hurry.

24:44.480 --> 24:44.980
Xiong Da.

24:45.440 --> 24:46.330
Move it, Xiong Lingli.

24:47.510 --> 24:48.460
Hurry, Xiong Lingli.

24:49.680 --> 24:50.290
Xiong Da.

24:52.480 --> 24:53.860
Did you gain weight, Xiong Lingli?

24:53.880 --> 24:55.090
No way.

24:55.590 --> 24:57.420
I work out a lot.

24:57.440 --> 24:59.810
Keep going. I'm almost there.

24:59.830 --> 25:01.620
I can't get much leverage here.

25:06.400 --> 25:07.660
Xiong Da, what did you eat?

25:07.680 --> 25:08.770
I haven't had a thing.

25:08.790 --> 25:10.380
I'm on a diet lately.

25:10.550 --> 25:11.810
Keep going.

25:19.680 --> 25:20.420
Great.

25:20.790 --> 25:23.330
Now we can see what happened over there.

25:29.750 --> 25:30.730
It's over?

25:34.440 --> 25:35.770
Let's go down.

25:36.880 --> 25:38.810
Do we have to go back?

25:57.510 --> 25:59.900
It's for your liquor.

26:12.110 --> 26:12.770
Aunt.

26:28.880 --> 26:29.770
Disciple Changshou,

26:30.750 --> 26:31.810
are you okay?

26:32.510 --> 26:33.140
I'm fine.

26:33.550 --> 26:34.330
Really?

26:35.350 --> 26:35.940
Really.

26:36.440 --> 26:37.330
Are you sure?

26:38.240 --> 26:38.940
Sure.

26:39.960 --> 26:41.140
Wonderful.

26:42.550 --> 26:43.330
Mentor.

26:43.920 --> 26:45.460
I won't be if you keep hitting me.

26:45.550 --> 26:46.460
I'm telling you,

26:46.550 --> 26:47.940
even if it's a small matter,

26:47.960 --> 26:49.180
it'd still be worth it.

26:49.270 --> 26:51.420
A great blessing for our division.

26:52.590 --> 26:54.090
We won big today.

26:55.310 --> 26:56.620
All past Grandlords.

26:56.640 --> 26:57.980
Our division is so blessed.

26:58.000 --> 26:59.530
Not composed at all.

27:00.160 --> 27:01.490
Well said.

27:01.720 --> 27:02.490
Jiu Jiu,

27:02.790 --> 27:03.900
as for these two disciples,

27:03.920 --> 27:05.980
let's not move them to Griefbane.

27:06.030 --> 27:06.900
We won't?

27:06.920 --> 27:07.460
Right.

27:07.480 --> 27:09.330
Staying at Jade Division is fine.

27:10.400 --> 27:12.140
But Changshou's liquor is so good.

27:12.240 --> 27:13.900
Then you'll buy my liquor for me.

27:14.350 --> 27:15.530
No stopping me.

27:15.550 --> 27:18.010
So the Seizing and Human Sects

27:18.030 --> 27:20.050
are all worthless.

27:20.550 --> 27:22.380
And Ascendance Sect disciples

27:22.750 --> 27:24.860
actually obsess over money.

27:25.350 --> 27:27.460
What a waste of cultivation.

27:29.440 --> 27:30.290
I'll protect you.

27:32.750 --> 27:33.530
Hey, kid.

27:34.000 --> 27:35.250
You are indeed an immortal seedling.

27:42.240 --> 27:43.140
Stop pretending.

27:43.350 --> 27:44.140
You are

27:45.070 --> 27:46.420
Changgeng.

27:46.440 --> 27:47.090
Changgeng?

27:47.110 --> 27:47.770
Changgeng?

27:48.110 --> 27:48.900
Who is Changgeng?

27:48.920 --> 27:50.620
A Jade disciple as Changgeng?

27:50.640 --> 27:52.090
Elucidating Sect plays it well,

27:52.110 --> 27:53.660
but they're blind.

27:53.680 --> 27:55.180
What are you laughing at?

27:55.200 --> 27:56.330
No offense.

27:56.830 --> 27:57.810
Jade Division

27:58.270 --> 28:00.810
is Ascendance's weakest branch.

28:04.240 --> 28:05.050
Please don't take it to heart.

28:05.680 --> 28:07.050
I'm only speaking the truth.

28:07.440 --> 28:08.180
Not at all.

28:10.920 --> 28:13.530
You're saying Changgeng is from there?

28:13.880 --> 28:14.660
I'm sorry.

28:15.070 --> 28:16.730
That is simply impossible.

28:17.270 --> 28:18.810
You all saw it yourself.

28:18.920 --> 28:21.140
That kid used a basic formation

28:21.440 --> 28:22.980
to such an extent.

28:23.240 --> 28:24.620
Remarkable skills.

28:26.240 --> 28:29.460
I didn't make it alone.

28:29.550 --> 28:31.490
Aunt Jiu Jiu helped the most.

28:31.960 --> 28:32.730
That's her.

28:34.440 --> 28:35.180
Me?

28:37.750 --> 28:39.330
I'm exhausted.

28:39.790 --> 28:40.810
Aunt Jiu Jiu rules.

28:41.350 --> 28:43.010
Only 0.03% completed.

28:44.160 --> 28:46.090
It's nothing. Not worth mentioning.

28:46.440 --> 28:47.010
That's enough.

28:47.240 --> 28:48.180
Right. Keep it low key.

28:49.400 --> 28:52.050
Since a senior helped,

28:52.750 --> 28:54.090
making this formation

28:54.110 --> 28:55.660
makes perfect sense.

28:58.590 --> 28:59.380
Hey,

29:00.590 --> 29:01.730
are you really not Changgeng?

29:02.270 --> 29:02.900
Changgeng?

29:03.200 --> 29:03.730
Who's that?

29:03.750 --> 29:04.290
Who's that?

29:04.310 --> 29:04.770
Who's that?

29:04.790 --> 29:05.220
Who's that?

29:05.240 --> 29:05.810
Who's that?

29:06.160 --> 29:06.940
Cultivator.

29:07.830 --> 29:08.940
It's a misunderstanding.

29:09.790 --> 29:12.700
Changgeng isn't in Ascendance Sect.

29:13.830 --> 29:14.730
I don't buy it.

29:15.200 --> 29:15.860
Here's more.

29:18.750 --> 29:20.180
The Realm Scroll?

29:20.350 --> 29:21.180
That's right.

29:21.750 --> 29:23.620
This is an Innate Treasure.

29:23.640 --> 29:25.530
The Realm Scroll.

29:27.110 --> 29:28.290
A replica.

29:29.750 --> 29:30.730
A replica?

29:31.110 --> 29:31.700
What?

29:31.720 --> 29:33.620
I painted this myself.

29:33.640 --> 29:34.420
The Mini

29:34.960 --> 29:36.660
Realm Scroll.

29:37.550 --> 29:38.620
You painted this?

29:39.070 --> 29:40.010
Then look all you want.

29:40.640 --> 29:41.660
You, who set up the formation.

29:42.550 --> 29:43.620
With this formation of mine,

29:43.920 --> 29:44.980
do you dare to try it?

29:45.000 --> 29:45.460
No.

29:45.510 --> 29:46.730
What's there to fear?

29:46.750 --> 29:47.330
Do you know how to...

29:47.350 --> 29:47.770
No.

29:47.960 --> 29:49.490
My formation is easy. Just try it.

29:49.510 --> 29:50.330
I don't want to.

29:57.750 --> 29:58.940
Senior Changshou,

29:59.350 --> 30:01.570
to keep peace between sects,

30:02.070 --> 30:03.090
you endure humiliation.

30:04.400 --> 30:05.530
Such fortitude.

30:06.240 --> 30:08.220
When will I ever match that?

30:16.160 --> 30:18.530
This disciple is weak,

30:19.160 --> 30:21.050
but unyieldingly so.

30:25.030 --> 30:25.810
Go.

30:25.960 --> 30:27.490
Why not?

30:34.550 --> 30:35.380
Kuai Si is the one

30:35.400 --> 30:37.290
with the Three-Dot Mark.

30:37.880 --> 30:39.220
Why not eliminate him?

30:39.920 --> 30:41.380
He's an Elder of Ascendance Sect.

30:41.400 --> 30:43.090
Killing him brings heavy karma.

30:43.160 --> 30:44.460
Have you thought about that?

30:46.030 --> 30:46.810
Everyone.

30:47.720 --> 30:51.330
Having the Three Sects here is rare.

30:51.640 --> 30:54.940
Since Chan Sect seeks a bout,

30:54.960 --> 30:56.490
why not take this chance

30:56.510 --> 30:58.730
to hold a Grand Assembly?

30:58.880 --> 31:00.530
Tomorrow at noon,

31:00.720 --> 31:02.330
we'll ask Cloudlink Hermit

31:02.350 --> 31:04.810
to set up the Mini Realm Scroll.

31:04.830 --> 31:08.730
Anyone who wishes can challenge it.

31:08.790 --> 31:12.530
Consider it a friendly exchange.

31:13.160 --> 31:13.810
What do you say?

31:16.200 --> 31:17.010
Sure.

31:17.550 --> 31:19.090
Tomorrow at noon then.

31:19.270 --> 31:21.700
I'll offer our sacred pearl as a prize.

31:22.400 --> 31:23.660
Come and claim it.

31:33.180 --> 31:36.180
[Hall of Virtue]

31:41.310 --> 31:44.770
So it was you
spreading rumors about Changgeng

31:45.750 --> 31:48.220
and luring people to Ascendance Sect?

31:50.680 --> 31:53.220
Elder, are you blaming us?

31:55.480 --> 31:57.330
Hypocrites.

31:58.110 --> 31:59.220
You fiend.

32:02.160 --> 32:03.700
What is your purpose

32:04.350 --> 32:06.090
in coming to Ascendance Sect?

32:08.790 --> 32:10.530
What purpose could we have?

32:11.000 --> 32:13.810
Once you take the grand seat,

32:13.960 --> 32:14.860
the entire Ascendance Sect

32:14.880 --> 32:16.860
will be Westdawn Sect's ally.

32:17.880 --> 32:19.290
Elder Kuai Si

32:19.880 --> 32:21.730
is a crucial figure for us.

32:25.000 --> 32:26.460
Glad you know it.

32:30.720 --> 32:33.570
Aren't you afraid Changgeng is here?

32:33.880 --> 32:37.010
He survived
the Divine-Demon Tribulation.

32:40.720 --> 32:43.180
I am already an Aureate Immortal.

32:43.510 --> 32:45.140
In the entire Ascendance Sect,

32:45.160 --> 32:45.860
except for Detached Master,

32:45.880 --> 32:47.380
no one is a match for me.

32:48.070 --> 32:50.330
A coward hiding in the shadows

32:50.480 --> 32:52.660
doesn't even have the courage

32:52.680 --> 32:53.460
to face me.

32:53.960 --> 32:55.250
Why should I fear him?

32:55.440 --> 32:56.220
What if

32:56.920 --> 32:58.660
he is hiding on purpose?

33:00.160 --> 33:00.980
Perhaps

33:01.270 --> 33:03.770
he is Detached Master's secret card,

33:04.680 --> 33:06.250
waiting for you to drop your guard

33:07.440 --> 33:09.460
to deal a fatal blow.

33:15.030 --> 33:17.250
Our plan to take over Ascendance Sect

33:17.830 --> 33:19.420
must go perfectly.

33:20.110 --> 33:21.980
You have sacrificed too much for this.

33:22.030 --> 33:23.050
If we fail,

33:23.110 --> 33:24.660
not only is it all for nothing,

33:25.440 --> 33:27.050
but you'll be charged with murder

33:27.070 --> 33:28.660
and betraying your own sect.

33:32.310 --> 33:34.700
I will never fail.

33:34.720 --> 33:35.940
If you don't want to fail,

33:36.240 --> 33:38.090
eliminate the threats early

33:38.640 --> 33:40.220
to ensure success.

33:47.880 --> 33:48.660
By the way,

33:49.480 --> 33:51.420
Changgeng has something

33:53.070 --> 33:54.330
that I want.

34:11.420 --> 34:13.070
[Seven days ago, Turtle Island]

34:13.070 --> 34:14.090
What happened to me?

34:15.590 --> 34:17.490
My Dragon Mark is gone?

34:25.190 --> 34:25.820
An illusion?

34:26.480 --> 34:27.460
Why can't I smell anything?

34:27.800 --> 34:28.340
An illusion.

34:28.710 --> 34:29.780
Transform into a dragon.

34:30.880 --> 34:31.980
Transform into a dragon.

34:43.030 --> 34:43.980
Who let you in?

34:44.590 --> 34:46.340
Duh. This is Turtle Island.

34:46.360 --> 34:47.650
I go wherever I want.

34:48.550 --> 34:49.420
Come out.

34:56.590 --> 34:57.610
Young lady,

34:58.000 --> 34:59.570
why are you so rude?

34:59.590 --> 35:01.050
I speak however I want.

35:01.070 --> 35:02.490
Didn't your parents teach you manners?

35:02.630 --> 35:03.900
I have no parents.

35:05.000 --> 35:06.090
No wonder you're so unruly.

35:06.110 --> 35:06.900
What did you say?

35:07.510 --> 35:08.690
Say that again.

35:12.280 --> 35:13.860
Once my power is restored,

35:13.880 --> 35:14.980
your little skills

35:15.150 --> 35:16.340
won't mean a thing to me.

35:16.480 --> 35:18.170
Fine. You're asking for it.

35:19.630 --> 35:20.570
Don't hit him.

35:21.030 --> 35:22.050
Why not?

35:22.150 --> 35:22.980
He is...

35:23.230 --> 35:24.010
What?

35:24.880 --> 35:26.340
He's a pitiful guy.

35:28.150 --> 35:29.940
Isn't everyone pitiful?

35:30.280 --> 35:31.340
Am I not pitiful?

35:31.510 --> 35:33.940
My family was killed by the Dragon Clan.

35:34.320 --> 35:35.490
Did I ever try to end it?

35:36.920 --> 35:37.460
You...

35:37.880 --> 35:39.090
Your family... by dragons?

35:39.280 --> 35:41.650
Yes. Dragon Calamity brought floods.

35:41.670 --> 35:42.820
The whole village was drowned.

35:43.070 --> 35:44.570
Only I survived.

35:47.960 --> 35:49.490
When I'm strong enough,

35:49.880 --> 35:52.130
I'll make the Dragon Clan pay in blood.

36:00.230 --> 36:01.170
I'm sorry.

36:01.840 --> 36:02.820
I didn't know.

36:06.920 --> 36:08.690
You said you can't smell anything?

36:08.920 --> 36:10.170
Take one bowl of this daily.

36:10.400 --> 36:11.300
It might help.

36:12.920 --> 36:14.690
There are many pitiful people.

36:14.710 --> 36:16.260
If everyone were like you,

36:16.280 --> 36:17.900
hiding and self-pitying,

36:18.230 --> 36:19.490
the world outside would be gone.

36:20.190 --> 36:22.260
The key is to stand on your own.

36:22.480 --> 36:23.900
Only by making yourself stronger,

36:24.230 --> 36:25.650
can you stop being pitiful.

36:26.480 --> 36:27.260
Understand?

36:28.670 --> 36:29.300
I understand.

36:30.630 --> 36:32.050
Careful, it's hot.

36:32.630 --> 36:33.570
Mentor.

36:33.800 --> 36:34.740
Your disciple pays respects.

36:38.110 --> 36:38.900
Please rise.

36:39.800 --> 36:40.940
Who are you bowing to?

36:41.150 --> 36:42.460
Senior is right.

36:42.480 --> 36:43.420
Only when I become stronger,

36:43.440 --> 36:44.650
I won't be pitiful.

36:44.840 --> 36:45.860
Please accept me as your disciple,
Mentor.

36:46.190 --> 36:47.380
That's not what I meant.

36:47.920 --> 36:48.740
This is inappropriate.

36:49.000 --> 36:50.460
You have a noble status.

36:50.760 --> 36:52.530
How do you know his status?

36:53.630 --> 36:54.380
I...

36:55.070 --> 36:56.130
I just guessed.

36:56.320 --> 36:57.300
I don't deserve this.

36:57.320 --> 36:58.780
How can I be your Mentor?

36:59.070 --> 37:01.460
You won't take me as a disciple?

37:13.070 --> 37:15.050
I think you should accept him.

37:15.070 --> 37:17.420
A spoiled young master like him,

37:17.670 --> 37:18.740
if left out in the world,

37:19.230 --> 37:20.650
wouldn't survive three days.

37:23.630 --> 37:25.090
I have an idea.

37:29.000 --> 37:32.050
I can accept you on my Mentor's behalf.

37:32.840 --> 37:35.050
We will be fellow disciples.

37:35.070 --> 37:36.210
What do you say?

37:38.760 --> 37:39.650
Mentor accepts you.

37:41.840 --> 37:42.690
Greetings, Senior.

37:42.840 --> 37:43.980
Good, Junior.

37:45.480 --> 37:46.820
Our Mentor is journeying the realms,

37:46.840 --> 37:48.260
so I will teach you

37:48.280 --> 37:50.010
and guide you on the path.

37:50.480 --> 37:51.300
From this day on,

37:51.320 --> 37:53.170
you are a Seizing Sect disciple.

37:53.880 --> 37:54.650
Hanzhi,

37:55.070 --> 37:56.530
greet your Uncle.

37:57.880 --> 37:58.650
It's fine.

37:58.670 --> 38:00.460
We'll just use our own terms.

38:01.110 --> 38:02.980
I'll call you Senior, you call me Uncle.

38:03.920 --> 38:05.090
That won't do at all.

38:05.110 --> 38:05.860
Why not?

38:05.880 --> 38:07.490
In Seizing Sect, we honor our teachers.

38:08.030 --> 38:08.820
Hanzhi?

38:11.440 --> 38:12.210
Hanzhi?

38:13.440 --> 38:15.340
Cansheng, keep an eye on her.

38:15.400 --> 38:16.690
Don't let her cause trouble.

38:21.590 --> 38:24.300
Yuan Ze greets
the East Sea's Second Prince.

38:25.440 --> 38:26.210
Shh.

38:26.670 --> 38:27.460
Senior.

38:28.110 --> 38:29.210
You know who I am?

38:30.480 --> 38:32.940
I am the Three Realms Know-It-All.

38:32.960 --> 38:33.860
Of course I know you are...

38:34.510 --> 38:35.300
Shh.

38:37.550 --> 38:38.940
Shh.

38:38.960 --> 38:42.050
Thanks for keeping my secret.

38:42.630 --> 38:43.650
No problem.

38:44.190 --> 38:46.860
If you leave, that's one thing.

38:47.030 --> 38:48.650
But if you stay on Turtle Island,

38:48.670 --> 38:50.610
what am I supposed to do?

38:51.320 --> 38:53.380
When I left the Dragon Palace,

38:53.400 --> 38:55.130
I never knew dragons

38:55.150 --> 38:56.740
had committed such great crimes.

38:57.880 --> 38:59.340
I only hope that from today on,

38:59.960 --> 39:00.940
I can make it up to her.

39:01.760 --> 39:02.260
Make it up to who?

39:05.150 --> 39:06.570
No one.

39:09.070 --> 39:09.820
Well done, Junior.

39:09.840 --> 39:10.260
Senior.

39:20.360 --> 39:21.420
The flute from the East Sea?

40:06.760 --> 40:08.210
Dragon Calamity brought floods.

40:08.230 --> 40:09.420
The whole village was drowned.

40:09.440 --> 40:11.010
Only I survived.

40:11.400 --> 40:12.610
When I'm strong enough,

40:12.760 --> 40:14.980
I'll make the Dragon Clan pay in blood.

40:45.000 --> 40:46.940
Who's playing the East Sea Jade Flute?

40:53.760 --> 40:54.340
Right.

40:54.710 --> 40:55.490
Senior taught me

40:55.800 --> 40:57.130
to use my spiritual sense.

41:35.070 --> 41:36.650
No, no. Don't move.

41:37.070 --> 41:38.820
Who are you? Why lure me here?

41:38.840 --> 41:39.820
Guess.

41:41.030 --> 41:42.740
You can play the East Sea Jade Flute.

41:44.190 --> 41:45.740
Did Father send you

41:45.920 --> 41:47.050
to take me back?

41:47.230 --> 41:48.130
And if so?

41:48.360 --> 41:50.340
I said I won't go back.

41:50.480 --> 41:51.490
You don't get to decide.

41:51.510 --> 41:52.340
No, wait.

41:52.400 --> 41:53.610
I will prove dragons are wrong,

41:53.630 --> 41:54.530
and my brother is wrong too.

42:04.590 --> 42:05.610
I came to the Mortal Realm

42:05.630 --> 42:07.340
to learn human cultivation.

42:07.360 --> 42:09.650
Only then can I revive our clan.

42:10.920 --> 42:12.380
What did you learn here?

42:12.920 --> 42:14.050
Let me see.

42:17.320 --> 42:19.340
I'll show you.

42:30.360 --> 42:31.860
A sneak attack?

43:05.870 --> 43:11.650
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

43:12.320 --> 43:19.020
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

43:20.550 --> 43:26.600
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

43:27.230 --> 43:33.680
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

43:34.420 --> 43:41.540
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

43:41.920 --> 43:48.820
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

43:49.200 --> 43:56.550
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

43:56.550 --> 44:03.720
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

44:19.860 --> 44:25.030
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

44:26.120 --> 44:33.140
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

44:34.330 --> 44:40.270
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

44:40.970 --> 44:48.050
♪Alas, our story is short♪

44:48.390 --> 44:55.500
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

44:55.820 --> 45:02.300
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

45:03.080 --> 45:10.290
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

45:10.680 --> 45:18.500
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
